  "notes": "USAGE: {批評|ひひょう} is commonly used for formal critiques of art, literature, music, and performances. It tends to be more analytical and professional than casual criticism.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{批評|ひひょう}する (to critique/review)\n・{批評|ひひょう}を{書|か}く (to write a review)\n・{批評|ひひょう}{家|か} (critic)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{批判|ひはん} - criticism (broader, including political/social)\n・{論評|ろんぴょう} - commentary, critique (more formal)",
